@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folder_items/{folder_item_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
Client -> API: 查询
API -> DB: 已被索引 SELECT
note right of DB
  没有复制可用的流程
  Normalized FOLDER_ITEM = source of truth; folder_projection 建造 snapshot
  自动 FOLDER_ITEM — 恢复的预影
  来源: 活跃的 USER_STREAM_BINDING + 规范性 STREAM.is_archived = false
  All chats = 所有的; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false
  一个 indexed join 其他 ready USER_STREAM_BINDING; 没有 N+1/COUNT/custom SQL
end note
DB --> API: 公开行
note right of API: 没有 outbox / 任务 / 事件
API --> Client: 200 JSON
@enduml
